                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. High chance of showers, most likely in the morning and early afternoon. The chance of a thunderstorm in the morning and afternoon. Winds east to northeasterly 25 to 35 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to between 10 and 17 with daytime temperatures reaching 26 to 33.</text>
